 --- Line used to calculate context.
 --- @field mode? 'cursor'|'topline'
 ---
+--- Show every enclosing scope, including scopes whose header line is still
+--- visible in the window. Off by default, where only scopes that have scrolled
+--- past the top of the window are shown.
+--- Note: the context window is an overlay drawn over the first lines of the
+--- window, so enabling this hides that many lines of real buffer text, and the
+--- context is still capped at the number of lines between the top of the window
+--- and the cursor.
+--- @field include_visible? boolean
+---
 --- Separator between context and content. Should be a single character string, like '-'.
 --- When separator is set, the context will only show up when there are at least 2 lines above cursorline.
 --- @field separator? string
